{"id":"n16205-1-8","stage":3,"title":"삼다 · 娶","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16205-1-8-1","ko":"친한 친구를 직장 상사로 삼게 될 줄이야.","zh":"没想到关系这么好的朋友，后来竟成了我的上司啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친한","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친한","audio":"/audio/c347bac4c86f6fc9265a.mp3"}},{"text":"친구를","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구를","audio":"/audio/3c7703f0cd2530410491.mp3"}},{"text":"직장","meaning":"工作单位，职场","explanation":"직장：工作单位，职场。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}},{"text":"상사로","meaning":"上司","explanation":"상사：上司；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"상사","audio":"/audio/cebb0bf130933be20d2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92501","senseId":"1","lemma":"상사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상사로","audio":"/audio/dffdb1fb179c74855d43.mp3"}},{"text":"삼게","meaning":"把朋友当作上司","explanation":"삼다：使某人成为与自己有关系的人；本句指把朋友当作上司；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"삼다","audio":"/audio/e87e0eedb74b47762143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16205","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼게","audio":"/audio/c9e9508dc955e61513f1.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"8","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"줄이야.","meaning":"没想到（-ㄹ 줄이야）","explanation":"줄：表示某种事实；-ㄹ 줄이야 合起来表示“没想到”；이야：强调或突出前面的对象，也可加强对比、条件等语气。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄이야","audio":"/audio/ccbabc01f51918f9cdbd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深厚。","pronunciation":["친하다"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"工作单位，职场","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而上班的地方。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"cebb0bf130933be2","term":"상사","zh":"上司","audio":"/audio/cebb0bf130933be20d2f.mp3","entryId":"92501","definition":"比自己职位高的人。","pronunciation":["상ː사"]},{"id":"e87e0eedb74b4776","term":"삼다","zh":"使某人成为与自己有关系的人；本句指把朋友当作上司","audio":"/audio/e87e0eedb74b47762143.mp3","entryId":"16205","definition":"使某人成为与自己有关系的人；本句指把朋友当作上司","pronunciation":["삼ː따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某种事实；-ㄹ 줄이야 合起来表示“没想到”","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某种事实；-ㄹ 줄이야 合起来表示“没想到”","pronunciation":["줄"]}],"audio":"/audio/b98cc4feda689fbf9132.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16205-1-8-2","ko":"정말 난감하겠다.","zh":"那可真是让人很为难呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","